   "ref_url": "https://docs.oracle.com/en/database/oracle/oracle-database/19/sqlrf/Nulls.html"
  },
  {
   "q": "[테이블] DEPT(ID, NAME): (10,영업),(20,개발),(30,인사),(40,총무)\nEMP(ID, NAME, DEPT, SAL, MGR): (1,김,10,300,NULL),(2,이,10,200,1),(3,박,20,250,1),(4,최,20,NULL,3),(5,정,30,400,1),(6,한,NULL,150,2)\nDEPT와 EMP를 LEFT OUTER JOIN 했을 때 '총무' 부서의 COUNT(E.ID) 값은?\nSELECT D.NAME, COUNT(E.ID) FROM DEPT D LEFT JOIN EMP E ON D.ID = E.DEPT GROUP BY D.NAME",
   "choices": [
    "1",
    "0",
    "2",
    "NULL",
    "4"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
